{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The harness starts level 5 after 108 moves. Clone probes identify color 9 as the avatar: actions 3 and 4 move it left and right. Clicking a yellow tile removes it remotely; clicking the orange tile changes the avatar’s vertical motion and is fatal from the entry position. I’ll test the existing gravity-switch leg on the wider board."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat > probe_route5.py <<'PY'\nfrom probe_level5 import A,json,safe_step,arr,connected_components\nfrom legs import navigate_consumable_gravity_switches\nclass Trace:\n def __init__(self,e): self.env=e;self.path=[]\n def __getattr__(self,n): return getattr(self.env,n)\n def step(self,*a):\n  self.path.append(a[0] if len(a)==1 else a)\n  self.env.step(*a)\n  f=arr(self.env.frame());bs=connected_components(f,colors=[9])\n  print(len(self.path),a,'pos',[b.bbox for b in bs], 'L',self.env.levels_completed,'T',self.env.terminal(),'rows',[''.join(format(int(f[y,3+x*6]),'x') for x in range(10)) for y in range(3,63,6)])\ndef run(e):\n for a in json.load(open('checkpoint.json'))['final_path']:safe_step(e,a)\n c=Trace(e.clone());navigate_consumable_gravity_switches(c,max_moves=70,origin=(3,3),shape=(10,10))\n print('END',len(c.path),c.levels_completed,c.terminal())\n json.dump(c.path,open('candidate_gravity5.json','w'))\nA.run_program('bp35',run)\nPY\npython probe_route5.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
